  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Jamaica Health Services Network Strengthening</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Jamaica requested IDB hybrid loan financing (policy and investment) to develop and implement policies to combat non-communicable diseases (NCDs) as well as to strengthen priority health care services networks (3 hospitals and associated health centres). A complementary EU-CIF grant would allow for the construction, remodelling, and expansion and provision of medical equipment for ten health centres in the catchment areas of the hospitals. This would help alleviate the pressure on the reference hospitals in Kingston from the large, underserved populations in three parishes of the countrys interior.</narrative>
  </description>
